#########################################################################
# STRATEGY: catalogue-docs-tracked
#
# Same as gitignore.omero-mvls-catalogue-excluded, except
# catalogue/docs/merge-into-omero-mvls/ (this runbook, merged-compose.yaml,
# merged-nginx.conf, certificates.sh, backup_mariadb.sh/restore_mariadb.sh,
# etc.) is carved out and stays tracked in omero-mvls's own git history -
# preserves a record of how and why this server's compose/nginx/certs
# setup got to its current state. Everything else under catalogue/
# (backend/, frontend/, thumbnails/, the rest of docs/, etc.) is still
# ignored - mvls-catalogue's own repo remains the source of truth for
# the application itself.
#
# The negation rules below (tested in a scratch repo before writing this
# file) rely on a gitignore quirk: you can't negate a path *inside* an
# already-ignored directory unless every intermediate directory level is
# also explicitly un-ignored. Hence three steps instead of one line:
#   1. catalogue/*                        ignore everything directly under catalogue/
#   2. !catalogue/docs/                    but allow descending into docs/
#   3. catalogue/docs/*                    ignore everything directly under docs/
#   4. !catalogue/docs/merge-into-omero-mvls/   but allow descending into this one folder
#########################################################################

#########################################################################
# Secrets
#########################################################################
.env

#########################################################################
# Certificates - by file type rather than the whole certs/ folder, so
# anything else placed there isn't silently hidden too.
#   *.key - private keys (omero.key, server.key) - real secrets.
#   *.p12 - PKCS12 bundles (server.p12) - embeds the private key.
#   *.pem - certificates/chains (fullchain.pem, server.pem) and DH
#           params (ffdhe2048.pem) - not secret, but generated by
#           certificates.sh / renewed by IT, not source.
#########################################################################
*.key
*.p12
*.pem

# certs/README.md specifically (not certs/ generally - see above) is a
# stale hand-written note that doesn't match the current setup (it
# references "omeroJM.key" instead of the actual "omero.key", and
# describes separate CertFile/KeyFile properties instead of the actual
# single CertFile server.p12 approach extra.omero uses) - excluded so
# it isn't accidentally committed as-is. Superseded by RUNBOOK.md /
# SETUP.md; delete it or bring it up to date before untracking this
# line.
certs/README.md

#########################################################################
# Database backups (pg_dump output from backup_database.sh)
#########################################################################
backups/

#########################################################################
# External OMERO data (bind-mounted from OMEROFILESEXTERNALPATH) - real
# slide/image data, not part of this repo.
#########################################################################
OMERO/

#########################################################################
# Stray manual backup files from hand-editing configs before a change
# (nginx.conf.old, fullchain.pem.old, omero.oldkey, etc.)
#########################################################################
*.old
*.oldkey
*.bak

#########################################################################
# MVLS Catalogue app - separate project with its own git repo/history.
# Ignored here EXCEPT the merge documentation folder, which stays
# tracked - see explanation at the top of this file.
#########################################################################
catalogue/*
!catalogue/docs/
catalogue/docs/*
!catalogue/docs/merge-into-omero-mvls/
